Subject: Re: "fork here" with Rserve 1.8-1
In-Reply-To: <709C127B0A89FE4D9E8EBCC3ABE7D00C8BD92DE8@hd1srvms0012.analytical-software.eu>
References: <709C127B0A89FE4D9E8EBCC3ABE7D00C8BD92DE8@hd1srvms0012.analytical-software.eu>
